{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53945","headline":"赠沙州僧悟真上人兼送归 · 景导","name":"赠沙州僧悟真上人兼送归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河湟旧邑新道复，天竺名僧汉地来。\n经论三乘鶖子辩，诗吟五字慧休才。\n登山振杖穿云锡，渡水还浮逆浪杯。\n明日玉阶辞圣主，恩光西迈送书回。\n（斯四六五四卷。\n原署：「左街保寿寺供奉讲论大德景导。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"景导","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}